ifies Chalmers Library as Kenyon’s library and publishes live building, circulation, archives and technology-center service hours.","source_url":"https://library.kenyon.edu/","source_title":"Chalmers Library | Kenyon College","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Consult the official live schedule on the day of the visit; building and service-desk hours differ and may change between terms.","cost_status":"not_applicable","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"kenyon-gund-gallery","subject_type":"sequence_stop","entity_name":"The Gund","title":"Saturday: Make an Art Stop","subtitle":"Stop 5 · Visit The Gund’s exhibitions","notes":"Choose one current exhibition or collection display to examine closely, and confirm the day’s opening window on The Gund’s visit page first.","short_summary":"Add a free contemporary-art visit to the middle of Saturday.","evidence_claim":"The Gund states that its Gambier museum welcomes all visitors to its collection, temporary exhibitions and public programs with free admission all year.","source_url":"https://www.thegund.org/visit","source_title":"Visit The Gund | All Welcome. Always Free.","source_kind":"cultural_institution","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Use the current hours posted on the official visit page; the museum is at 101½ College Drive between Cromwell Cottage and Chalmers Library.","cost_status":"free","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"kenyon-bookstore","subject_type":"sequence_stop","entity_name":"Kenyon College Bookstore","title":"Saturday: Browse the Village Hub","subtitle":"Stop 6 · Step into the Bookstore","notes":"Browse the shelves and notice how the shop anchors the village center; confirm current opening hours before making it a fixed part of your route.","short_summary":"See the literary gathering place at the seam between campus and village.","evidence_claim":"Kenyon’s official virtual tour identifies the Bookstore as a gathering space in the heart of the village and an important hub of Kenyon’s literary scene.","source_url":"https://www.kenyon.edu/kenyon-on-a-tour/","source_title":"Kenyon on a Tour | Kenyon College","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Retail hours are not stated on the cited tour page; verify current hours before visiting. Browsing does not obligate a purchase.","cost_status":"unknown","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"kenyon-lowry-center","subject_type":"sequence_stop","entity_name":"Lowry Center","title":"Saturday: Sample Campus Recreation","subtitle":"Stop 7 · Tour the Lowry Center","notes":"Walk through the student-accessible areas and identify one recreation option for a later visit, following posted rules for each specialized facility.","short_summary":"Learn the layout of Kenyon’s large indoor recreation complex.","evidence_claim":"Kenyon describes the Lowry Center as a 265,000-square-foot facility with a pool, indoor track, courts, fitness spaces, study lounges and a movie theater.","source_url":"https://www.kenyon.edu/campus-life/clubs-organizations/recreation-fitness/","source_title":"Recreation and Fitness | Kenyon College","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Entry, equipment use and individual facility availability are governed by current Lowry Center membership, access and operating policies.","cost_status":"unknown","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"kenyon-kokosing-gap-trail","subject_type":"sequence_stop","entity_name":"Kokosing Gap Trail","title":"Sunday: Follow the Trail Access","subtitle":"Stop 8 · Walk from Kenyon’s trailhead","notes":"Begin at Kenyon’s access point behind the 